    {
      "@type": "Book",
      "@id": "https://milos-timotijevic.github.io/books/kulturna-riznica-cacka.html#work",
      "url": "https://milos-timotijevic.github.io/books/kulturna-riznica-cacka.html",
      "name": "Културна ризница Чачка: од праисторије до савременог доба",
      "alternateName": [
        "Cultural Treasury of Čačak: From Prehistory to the Present Time",
        "Cultural Treasury of Cacak from Prehistory to the Present Time",
        "Kulturna riznica Čačka: od praistorije do savremenog doba"
      ],
      "description": "Двојезична синтетичка научна монографија о културном, уметничком и материјалном наслеђу Чачка од праисторије до савременог доба. Историјски преглед служи као контекст за избор и тумачење културних добара, просторних целина, предмета, архитектуре, сакралног наслеђа и урбаних симбола, при чему публикација повезује научно истраживање, музејску документацију, визуелну репрезентацију и јавну историју.",
      "abstract": "A bilingual synthetic scholarly monograph on the cultural, artistic and material heritage of Čačak from prehistory to the early twenty-first century. The book uses a concise long-term history of the city and its surroundings as contextual framing for the interpretation of cultural values, objects, buildings, spatial ensembles and artistic heritage. Selection is not restricted to legally designated cultural monuments: it also includes material remains that marked particular epochs or became recognizable symbols of the city. Combining archaeology, history, art history, museum documentation and extensive visual material, the publication functions simultaneously as a scholarly synthesis, a reference work and a public presentation of local heritage and identity.",
      "genre": [
        "Scholarly monograph",
        "Heritage synthesis",
        "Local history",
        "Museum publication",
        "Art history",
        "Archaeology",
        "Public history"
      ],
