    {
      "@type": "Book",
      "@id": "https://milos-timotijevic.github.io/books/nadezda-petrovic-life-art-service-nation.html#work",
      "url": "https://milos-timotijevic.github.io/books/nadezda-petrovic-life-art-service-nation.html",
      "name": "Надежда Петровић: живот и уметност у служби нације",
      "alternateName": [
        "Nadežda Petrović: Life and Art in the Service of the Nation",
        "Nadezda Petrovic: Life and Art in the Service of the Nation"
      ],
      "description": "Историјско-биографска научна монографија о Надежди Петровић (1873–1915), која анализира међусобну условљеност модерне уметности, српског национализма, југословенске идеје, културних елита, јавног ангажмана, националне мобилизације, ратног искуства и посмртног симболичког значења.",
      "abstract": "Historical-biographical study of Nadežda Petrović (1873–1915) examining how family background, European artistic education, Serbian nationalism and an evolving Yugoslav orientation shaped the mutual conditioning of her modernist art, public activism and political engagement. Drawing on lesser-known sources, archival material, press, private correspondence and a critical reinterpretation of published documents, the book also examines her wartime service and the posthumous transformation of her death into a symbol of artistic and national sacrifice.",
      "author": {
        "@id": "https://milos-timotijevic.github.io/#person"
      },
      "inLanguage": "sr",
      "genre": [
        "Scholarly monograph",
        "Biography",
