    {
      "@type": "Book",
      "@id": "https://milos-timotijevic.github.io/books/dragisa-vasic-serbian-national-idea.html#work",
      "url": "https://milos-timotijevic.github.io/books/dragisa-vasic-serbian-national-idea.html",
      "name": "Драгиша Васић и српска национална идеја",
      "alternateName": [
        "Драгиша Васић (1885–1945) и српска национална идеја",
        "Dragiša Vasić and the Serbian National Idea",
        "Dragiša Vasić (1885–1945) and the Serbian National Idea",
        "Dragiša Vasić i srpska nacionalna ideja"
      ],
      "description": "Интелектуална и политичка биографија Драгише Васића која прати стварање и преобликовање његове српске националне идеје од грађанског и либералног окружења пред Балканске ратове, преко ратног искуства 1912–1920. и међуратног књижевног и политичког ангажмана, до Равногорског покрета, Другог светског рата и послератног памћења.",
      "abstract": "An intellectual and political biography of Dragiša Vasić (1885–1945) that traces the formation and transformation of his Serbian national idea across civic family background, liberal-democratic convictions, the Balkan Wars and First World War, postwar literary and public activity, interwar political engagement, the Serbian Cultural Club, the Ravna Gora movement, and postwar memory. The study treats national identity and sacrifice for the homeland as central problems in Vasić's literary and public work, while examining tensions among liberalism, nationalism, Yugoslavism, modernity, political violence and historical memory.",
      "genre": [
        "Scholarly monograph",
        "Intellectual history",
        "Political history",
        "Cultural history",
        "Biography",
        "History of political thought"
      ],
      "author": {
        "@id": "https://milos-timotijevic.github.io/#person"
      },
