    {
      "@type": "Book",
      "@id": "https://milos-timotijevic.github.io/books/usklici-iskrenog-odusevljenja.html#work",
      "url": "https://milos-timotijevic.github.io/books/usklici-iskrenog-odusevljenja.html",
      "name": "Усклици искреног одушевљења: ефемерни спектакл и путовање краља Александра и краљице Драге Обреновић по Србији 1901. године",
      "alternateName": [
        "Exclamations of Sincere Enthusiasm: The Ephemeral Spectacle and the Journey of King Alexander and Queen Draga Obrenović through Serbia in 1901",
        "Usklici iskrenog oduševljenja: efemerni spektakl i putovanje kralja Aleksandra i kraljice Drage Obrenović po Srbiji 1901. godine"
      ],
      "description": "Научна монографија Милоша Тимотијевића и Александра Марушића о путовању краља Александра и краљице Драге Обреновић по Србији 1901. године, анализираном као ефемерни спектакл, политички ритуал, јавни перформанс и средство симболичке легитимације у условима кризе династичког ауторитета.",
      "abstract": "A microhistorical and cultural-political study of the 1901 journey of King Alexander and Queen Draga Obrenović through Serbia, interpreted as an ephemeral spectacle, political ritual and instrument of symbolic legitimation during a crisis of dynastic authority. The book reconstructs how direct contact with the population, ceremonial receptions, speeches, ephemeral decoration, flags and music, church and military participation, local elites, the awarding of honours, selected sites of memory and press mediation produced and negotiated political loyalty. It also shows that public enthusiasm was heterogeneous: loyalty could be genuine, ceremonial, locally conditioned, interest-driven or politically opportunistic.",
      "genre": [
        "Scholarly monograph",
        "Political history",
        "Cultural history",
        "Microhistory",
        "Symbolic politics",
        "History of political ritual"
      ],
      "author": [
        {
          "@id": "https://milos-timotijevic.github.io/#person"
        },
        {
          "@type": "Person",
          "name": "Aleksandar Marušić",
